## How did structured Storybook models become the bridge?

**I treated the implemented codebase as the single source of truth.** Storybook was already documenting our tokens, component schemas, and content rules across primitive tokens, markup templates, and realistic story permutations. Rather than adapting a generic third-party starter kit or relying entirely on off-the-shelf tools like [story.to.design](https://story.to.design/docs/extend-stories), I set out to compile Mangrove's existing data directly into Figma.

